[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2231190799","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2515#issuecomment-2231190799","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2515","id":2231190799,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86E_UUP","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-07-16T15:14:30Z","updated_at":"2024-07-16T15:14:30Z","body":"Text of requested license, copying from the fedora-license-data link in the request above:\r\n\r\n```\r\n        Permission is hereby granted, free of charge, to any person obtaining a copy of this\r\n        software and associated documentation files (the <quote>Software</quote>), to deal in the\r\n        Software without restriction, including without limitation the rights to use, copy, modify,\r\n        merge, publish, distribute, sublicense, and/or sell copies of the Software, and to permit\r\n        persons to whom the Software is furnished to do so, subject to the following conditions:  \r\n             \r\n              The above copyright notice and this permission notice shall be included in all\r\n              copies or substantial portions of the Software. \r\n           \r\n              Except as contained in this notice, the names of individuals credited with\r\n              contribution to this software shall not be used in advertising or otherwise to promote\r\n              the sale, use or other dealings in this Software without prior written authorization\r\n              from the individuals in question. \r\n           \r\n              Any stylesheet derived from this Software that is publicly distributed will be\r\n              identified with a different name and the version strings in any derived Software will\r\n              be changed so that no possibility of confusion between the derived package and this\r\n              Software will exist. \r\n \r\n          THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED \"AS IS\", WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED,\r\n          INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO THE WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR\r\n          PURPOSE AND NONINFRINGEMENT. IN NO EVENT SHALL DAVID CRAMER, KASUN GAJASINGHE, OR ANY\r\n          OTHER CONTRIBUTOR BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER LIABILITY, WHETHER IN AN\r\n          ACTION OF CONTRACT, TORT OR OTHERWISE, ARISING FROM, OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE\r\n          SOFTWARE OR THE USE OR OTHER DEALINGS IN THE SOFTWARE.\r\n```\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2231190799/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2231228507","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2515#issuecomment-2231228507","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2515","id":2231228507,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86E_dhb","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-07-16T15:26:37Z","updated_at":"2024-07-16T15:26:37Z","body":"I'm +1 to add this, as a historical modified MIT-style license with two additional clauses that generally relate to avoiding misuse of names / marks.\r\n\r\nRegarding the name / ID:\r\n\r\n* I don't know this space, but some of the uses / references I'm finding relating to this license ([example 1](https://github.com/docbook/xslt10-stylesheets/blob/master/xsl/webhelp/docsrc/readme.xml), [example 2](https://github.com/docbook/xslt10-stylesheets/blob/master/xsl/COPYING), [example 3](https://www.maplesoft.com/support/help/maple/view.aspx?path=License/DocBook), [example 4](https://docs.nvidia.com/networking-ethernet-software/cumulus-linux-56/Whats-New/licenses/docbook-xsl.txt)) appear to refer to this as part of \"xsl\" or \"docbook-xsl\" rather than \"DocBook XML\".\r\n* Given that, maybe an ID of `DocBook-XSL` and full name \"DocBook XSL License\"? Or please feel free to let me know if that's not preferable here given the technical space for this one.\r\n\r\nFormatting notes for markup:\r\n\r\n* the `<quote>...</quote>` tags around \"Software\" in the second line should presumably just be replaced with standard quotation marks.\r\n* in some of the examples, there's a \"Warranty\" line just above the final paragraph. I'd suggest including that with `<optional></optional` tags in the markup. (Some, but not all, examples also have hyphens that appear under \"Warranty\", so that should probably also be its own optional line as well.)\r\n* I haven't done this yet, but probably worth running redlines on a few of the examples above, to see if there's any other differences that I'm missing from a very quick skim  :)\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2231228507/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2231274444","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2515#issuecomment-2231274444","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2515","id":2231274444,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86E_ovM","user":{"login":"Lupphes","id":36422511,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2NDIyNTEx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36422511?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lupphes","html_url":"https://github.com/Lupphes","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lupphes/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lupphes/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lupphes/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lupphes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lupphes/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lupphes/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lupphes/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lupphes/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Lupphes/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-07-16T15:47:05Z","updated_at":"2024-07-16T15:47:05Z","body":"I agree with the naming,  XSL is probably more specific about what it is. ","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2231274444/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2237380565","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2515#issuecomment-2237380565","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2515","id":2237380565,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86FW7fV","user":{"login":"richardfontana","id":1179636,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNzk2MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1179636?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana","html_url":"https://github.com/richardfontana","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/richardfontana/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-07-18T19:32:50Z","updated_at":"2024-07-18T19:32:50Z","body":"> Regarding the name / ID:\r\n> \r\n>  * I don't know this space, but some of the uses / references I'm finding relating to this license ([example 1](https://github.com/docbook/xslt10-stylesheets/blob/master/xsl/webhelp/docsrc/readme.xml), [example 2](https://github.com/docbook/xslt10-stylesheets/blob/master/xsl/COPYING), [example 3](https://www.maplesoft.com/support/help/maple/view.aspx?path=License/DocBook), [example 4](https://docs.nvidia.com/networking-ethernet-software/cumulus-linux-56/Whats-New/licenses/docbook-xsl.txt)) appear to refer to this as part of \"xsl\" or \"docbook-xsl\" rather than \"DocBook XML\".\r\n> * Given that, maybe an ID of `DocBook-XSL` and full name \"DocBook XSL License\"? Or please feel free to let me know if that's not preferable here given the technical space for this one. \r\n\r\nI guess the overall project/technology/standard is \"DocBook\" and DocBook XML and DocBook XSL are different parts of that technology. I don't know offhand how that relates to the licenses used including this one. But there's more than one DocBook-specific license. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2237380565/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/2249393876","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2515#issuecomment-2249393876","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2515","id":2249393876,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE86GEwbU","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.git